post_install() {
  cat <<EOF
Lenovo Vantage (unofficial) installed.

The privileged daemon is NOT started automatically. Enable it with:

    sudo systemctl daemon-reload
    sudo systemctl enable --now vantaged.service

If the daemon fails to own its D-Bus name, reload the system D-Bus once
(sudo systemctl reload dbus) or reboot.

Optional extras:
  - supergfxctl: GPU mode switching in the GUI
  - ryzenadj: custom TDP tuning on AMD CPUs
EOF
}
